      "id": 1,
      "text": "Arlington Heights was laid out in 1853 by James Waugh as the railroad arrived, marking the village’s birth along the Chicago, Burlington and Quincy line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
